Plant Monitor
-------------

Pflanzenmonitor Plus is an alternative to the custom integration "Plant Monitor"
(Olen/homeassistant-plant, https://github.com/Olen/homeassistant-plant, GNU General
Public License v3.0). To make existing automations, dashboards and cards keep
working after moving over by hand, it offers compatible behaviour: the same status
values and attributes (ok/problem, <measurement>_status, problems, species), the
same limit defaults and unique ID suffixes, and comparable automation triggers and
conditions. It does not read, change or remove anything of Plant Monitor; it only
checks whether Plant Monitor is set up, to show a notice with the moving guide.

No source code of Plant Monitor is included or adapted here; the behaviour was
re-implemented independently. Plant Monitor is not required and is not
affiliated with this project.
